WEBVTT

00:12:58.618 --> 00:13:01.138
and misplaced and a misconception.

00:13:01.138 --> 00:13:05.838
What else Google as a company is doing,
would you enlighten us a bit on that?

00:13:07.118 --> 00:13:09.778
Today we have over seven products

00:13:09.778 --> 00:13:12.308
that are used by a billion users each.

00:13:12.308 --> 00:13:15.188
And as Shah Rukh mentioned 'Search',

00:13:15.188 --> 00:13:19.378
be it, Gmail, Google Maps, 
Google Photos or YouTube,

00:13:20.740 --> 00:13:23.280
we have also built products 
like Chrome and Android.

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:28.030
They are platforms, so others use it 
to build smartphones and computers.

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:31.880
We do many things across the company.